~ start
if not GameState.talked_to_gary:
	Garry: Hi Taiyaki its been a while Glep told me you were coming
	Garry: Last time I saw you was when you were tiny kitten
	Garry: Have how you been
	- Who are you?
		Garry: Oh you dont remeber
	- Im confuesed where am I?
		Garry: Oh you dont remmeber
	Garry: I was told about the incident
	- The incident?
		Garry: Oh nothing
	- What?
		Garry: Dont worry about it
	Garry: Im Garry btw
	Garry: Here I need some help pushing boxes
	Garry: My dwarf body has grown weak and cant get up [wait=1] you just need to push the box to the indicaated spot
	$> GameState.talked_to_gary = true 
	
	$> get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://minigame2/level0.tscn")
elif not GameState.area2unlock:
	Garry: Hi you got that taiyaki
	- yes
		if GameState.taiyaki_caught>=10:
			Garry: wow congrats 
			Garry: Well I better tell u who you are
			Garry: Your owner left you here in the alternate demension
			Garry: Your name is taiyaki
			Garry: Your journey starts here head inland you should meet "garry"
			Garry: He is a dwarf
			Garry: I hope your journey goes well
			Garry: visit sometime will ya?
			$> GameState.area2unlock = true
		else:
			Garry: Garry is very upset u lied
			Garry: go fish and get the remaining taiyaki
	- no
		if GameState.taiyaki_caught>=10:
			Garry: But u caught 10 taiyaki why did u lie to me?
			Garry: well congrats 
			Garry: Well I better tell u who you are
			Garry: Your owner left you here in the alternate demension
			Garry: Your name is taiyaki
			Garry: Your journey starts here head inland you should meet "garry"
			Garry: He is a dwarf
			Garry: I hope your journey goes well
			Garry: visit sometime will ya?
			$> GameState.area2unlock = true
		else:
			Garry: Go fish then!!! [wait=1] What are you waiting for?
else:
	Garry: Hey thanks
	Garry: How is that journey going for ya
	- its tireing
		Garry: hey dont give up keep going im rooting for u
	- good
		Garry: thats good to hear
	Garry: Well it was nice seeing u again stop by anytime
=> END